      button Small @374,3352,68,36
    text HTML @42,3400,669,20
    text <div class="buttons are-small"> <button class="button">Small</button> <button class="button">Small</button> <button class="button">Small</button> <button class="button is-normal">Normal</button> <button class="button">Small</button> </div> @42,3432,669,61
    button Copy danger @42,3505,669,36
    h3 "Responsive sizes #" @42,3553,669,19
    text If you want different button sizes for each breakpoint, you can use Bulma's responsive buttons. Simply append the is-responsive modifier: @42,3584,669,41
    table Name "Fixed size" "Responsive size (resize window to see in action)" Code:badge @42,3637,669,209
      Default | Default | Default | <button class="button is-responsive"> Default </button>Copy
      Small | Small | Small | <button class="button is-small is-responsive"> Small </button>Copy
      Normal | Normal | Normal | <button class="button is-normal is-responsive"> Normal </button>Copy
      Medium | Medium | Medium | <button class="button is-medium is-responsive"> Medium </button>Copy
      Large | Large | Large | <button class="button is-large is-responsive"> Large </button>Copy
    text You can customise the sizes by overwriting the $button-responsive-sizes Sass variable. @42,3858,669,20
