    h3 "States #" @42,4877,669,18
    text Bulma styles the different states of its buttons. Each state is available as a pseudo-class and a CSS class: @42,4907,669,41
    text :hover and is-hovered @42,4960,669,20
    text :focus and is-focused @42,4992,669,21
    text :active and is-active @42,5025,669,20
    text This allows you to obtain the style of a certain state without having to trigger it. @42,5057,669,20
